WEBVTT

00:00.810 --> 00:06.460
<i>Seiichi and the wounded Louise set off 
from Barbador Magic Academy.</i>

00:06.900 --> 00:09.140
<i>After they arrived,</i>

00:09.140 --> 00:15.130
<i>the Wimberg Kingdom and the Demon Kingdom 
successfully forged their alliance.</i>

00:15.130 --> 00:19.240
<i>Meanwhile, back at Barbador Magic Academy,</i>

00:19.240 --> 00:24.040
<i>Airin was acting somewhat suspiciously...</i>

00:25.050 --> 00:27.330
Guess it's about time.

00:30.510 --> 00:35.010
<i>This week, we're starting with what 
happened at Barbador Magic Academy</i>

00:35.010 --> 00:37.890
<i>shortly after Seiichi left 
for the Wimberg Kingdom.</i>

00:39.740 --> 00:43.230
Seiichi-sensei, take care.

00:43.680 --> 00:46.320
Well, time to head back to the cafeteria.

00:46.320 --> 00:49.510
That's all you ever do, glutton.

00:49.510 --> 00:52.300
All right, back to the classroom.

00:52.300 --> 00:53.520
Time to head back.

00:52.900 --> 00:55.620
I wish I could have gone with the boss man.

00:53.520 --> 00:54.820
Time to eat more!

00:54.820 --> 00:56.700
You <i>still</i> want to eat?

01:01.690 --> 01:05.410
What's wrong? You're usually much more lively.

01:05.820 --> 01:08.550
You think Sei-chan will be okay?

01:08.550 --> 01:10.550
It's Seiichi-kun we're talking about.

01:10.550 --> 01:12.670
Of course he'll be fine.

01:12.670 --> 01:14.300
I hope you're right.

01:15.520 --> 01:17.550
I hope you're right.

01:19.070 --> 01:22.180
Well, I'm going back to the classroom.

01:26.060 --> 01:30.320
Will everything really be all right, Sei-chan?

01:30.320 --> 01:33.080
Without you here at the academy?

01:37.820 --> 01:41.740
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

01:37.820 --> 01:41.740
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

01:38.900 --> 01:41.740
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

01:38.900 --> 01:41.740
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

01:38.900 --> 01:41.740
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

03:04.530 --> 03:09.100
<b>Gempel the Doppelganger</b>

03:06.240 --> 03:08.430
<i>I'm Gempel the Doppelganger.</i>

03:09.280 --> 03:12.860
<i>The man who would one day be known as one 
of the top four of the Great Devil Order.</i>

03:13.700 --> 03:15.450
<i>Believe it or not, when I was a child,</i>

03:15.450 --> 03:19.580
<i>I grew up as an upper-class noble 
who didn't lack for anything.</i>

03:20.440 --> 03:23.950
<i>But my heart never felt fulfilled.</i>

03:23.950 --> 03:26.400
<i>I'd always realized it.</i>

03:26.400 --> 03:32.520
<i>People weren't approaching me. 
They were only after my status as a noble.</i>

03:33.100 --> 03:35.560
<i>Even my parents didn't show me any love.</i>

03:36.260 --> 03:40.440
<i>I was nothing more than a tool to 
inherit and continue their lineage.</i>

03:41.190 --> 03:44.390
<i>No one paid attention to my true face.</i>

03:44.390 --> 03:48.900
<i>The moment I fell into despair over that 
was the moment I lost my face.</i>

03:49.840 --> 03:52.120
Airin? What are you doing?

03:52.560 --> 03:54.680
This is the men's bathroom.

03:55.420 --> 03:57.590
<i>One of Hiiragi Seiichi's students?</i>

03:57.590 --> 03:58.690
<i>Perfect timing.</i>

03:58.690 --> 04:00.710
What are you doing here?

04:00.710 --> 04:03.330
I came here to crush you two.

04:03.330 --> 04:05.600
To make Sei-chan feel despair.

04:05.600 --> 04:08.310
Sei-chan? You mean Seiichi-sensei?

04:08.310 --> 04:10.660
Airin! What in the world is wrong with you?!

04:10.660 --> 04:12.560
Here I go!

04:13.180 --> 04:15.600
What the hell do you think you're doing?!

04:15.600 --> 04:16.930
Doppelganger!

04:17.400 --> 04:18.940
S-So bright!

04:19.730 --> 04:21.570
This is what I'm doing!

04:21.570 --> 04:23.530
S-Saria-san?

04:24.990 --> 04:26.220
Transformation magic?

04:27.080 --> 04:29.490
Baird's got you beat in terms of power.

04:30.360 --> 04:32.080
I'm not so sure about that.

04:36.370 --> 04:37.580
She transformed?!

04:37.580 --> 04:39.180
Is that Airin's magic?!

04:39.180 --> 04:41.460
Whoa, man, what's going on?

04:41.460 --> 04:45.630
By the way, I can also copy their specs.

04:53.770 --> 04:56.800
I didn't know Airin had 
an ability like this.

04:57.640 --> 04:59.090
I'm...

04:59.090 --> 05:00.690
...not Airin!

05:00.690 --> 05:03.100
My true identity is...

05:05.520 --> 05:09.840
Gempel the Doppelganger, one of 
the Great Devil Order's top four!

05:07.990 --> 05:10.660
<b>Gempel the Doppelganger</b>

05:07.990 --> 05:10.660
<b>Gempel the Doppelganger</b>

05:10.660 --> 05:13.120
Well? Surprised, aren't you?

05:13.510 --> 05:18.240
When Seiichi gets back, 
I'll execute you before his eyes.

05:19.410 --> 05:21.070
Hiiragi Seiichi.

05:21.070 --> 05:25.470
I'll send everyone you 
cherish to the afterlife.

05:25.470 --> 05:26.940
Starting with...

05:36.850 --> 05:40.520
<i>A member of Hiiragi Seiichi's 
army, Lulune the Donkey.</i>

05:40.520 --> 05:43.290
<i>I'll bet he'll feel utter 
despair when he loses</i>

05:43.290 --> 05:45.740
<i>someone he's shared joys and sorrows with.</i>

05:46.350 --> 05:48.620
Your life is mine!

05:50.030 --> 05:50.900
What?!

05:51.280 --> 05:54.270
My food is mine!

05:54.270 --> 05:57.210
I won't let anyone take it!

05:57.210 --> 06:00.860
Huh? Food? I wasn't after that.

06:00.860 --> 06:02.670
<i>I was after your life!</i>

06:02.670 --> 06:04.920
Oh? Really?

06:04.920 --> 06:06.170
Really.

06:06.540 --> 06:07.570
Now that I look at you,

06:07.570 --> 06:09.780
you're Airin, from my class, right?

06:09.780 --> 06:11.140
<i>This girl's an idiot!</i>

06:11.140 --> 06:13.230
Sorry for surprising you.

06:13.230 --> 06:14.330
Don't worry about it.

06:14.330 --> 06:17.100
So, why did you sneak up on me from behind?

06:17.610 --> 06:19.030
<i>Overlook that part!</i>

06:19.030 --> 06:20.690
<i>Not good! Is she onto me?!</i>

06:22.250 --> 06:24.530
Are you...

06:27.460 --> 06:29.250
hungry, by chance?

06:29.250 --> 06:30.360
Huh?

06:30.360 --> 06:33.150
O-Oh, yes, I am!

06:36.460 --> 06:37.660
I see.

06:37.660 --> 06:40.040
Then here's my favorite!

06:40.040 --> 06:41.350
Bakudan!

06:41.350 --> 06:45.170
Being hungry always makes you want 
to attack from behind, doesn't it?

06:46.830 --> 06:48.190
No, it doesn't.

06:48.840 --> 06:51.830
You're the one who tried to save my master.

06:51.830 --> 06:53.150
So have this as thanks.

06:53.610 --> 06:57.400
Besides, it's nice to share food and 
eat it together every now and then.

06:59.300 --> 07:01.610
You're our friend, Airin.

07:03.280 --> 07:05.330
I wouldn't normally do this for others.

07:05.330 --> 07:07.220
You're special.

07:10.070 --> 07:11.530
<i>Friend...</i>

07:12.350 --> 07:14.350
Father, Mother.

07:14.350 --> 07:15.820
Be quiet.

07:15.820 --> 07:17.730
Today's meal is delicious.

07:17.730 --> 07:19.530
I'm so glad I made it.

07:35.130 --> 07:36.430
It's good.

07:38.720 --> 07:41.730
But why are you giving this to me?

07:41.730 --> 07:42.580
Huh?

07:42.580 --> 07:47.070
Well, partly to thank you 
for trying to save my master...

07:47.070 --> 07:49.830
What? Is it stuck in your throat?

07:49.830 --> 07:52.860
N-No, it's just my allergies.

07:53.490 --> 07:56.770
But food also tastes better 
when you eat with someone.

07:56.770 --> 07:59.920
Now we're best friends!

08:02.140 --> 08:05.860
<i>Best friends?!</i>

08:06.380 --> 08:08.750
<i>You dumbass!</i>

08:07.660 --> 08:10.850
Hey! Where are you going?!

08:09.600 --> 08:12.220
<i>I also have empyema!</i>

08:25.810 --> 08:27.380
<i>I might have failed earlier,</i>

08:27.380 --> 08:29.070
<i>but it won't go that way this time!</i>

08:29.440 --> 08:33.140
<i>Oliga, I'll be taking your life.</i>

08:33.140 --> 08:35.500
Oliga-chan!

08:35.500 --> 08:37.780
Oh, Glutton.

08:37.780 --> 08:40.870
<i>When she gets close, I'll snap her neck!</i>

08:43.790 --> 08:45.000
This girl?!

08:45.490 --> 08:47.180
Here's an umbrella.

08:47.180 --> 08:48.730
You didn't bring one, right?

08:51.780 --> 08:53.440
You hold it, Lulune.

08:53.440 --> 08:55.250
Since you're tall.

08:55.250 --> 08:56.720
S-Sure.

08:56.720 --> 08:59.890
It's an upper-class noble! Get him!

09:01.050 --> 09:02.890
Hand over that damn umbrella!

09:02.890 --> 09:04.520
Hey! Give it back!

09:04.520 --> 09:09.270
Gempel, I heard your family 
was stripped of its title.

09:09.270 --> 09:12.430
All this time, you acted like 
you were so much better than us!

09:15.790 --> 09:17.800
Why are you giving me an umbrella?

09:17.800 --> 09:19.710
You'll get all wet yourself.

09:20.240 --> 09:21.250
I'm fine.

09:21.250 --> 09:23.180
You may be a glutton,

09:23.180 --> 09:26.040
but you're a good girl who's 
always sharing food with me.

09:26.040 --> 09:29.590
Besides, you're my buddy.

09:34.670 --> 09:37.090
<i>I'm her buddy?!</i>

09:40.510 --> 09:43.720
<i>You dumbass!</i>

09:41.590 --> 09:44.620
Where are you going? You'll catch a cold.

09:43.720 --> 09:47.510
<i>Idiots don't catch colds!</i>

09:50.930 --> 09:53.820
<i>I swear, every single one of them...</i>

09:56.520 --> 09:57.580
<i>That's...</i>

09:58.690 --> 10:00.830
<i>Artoria the Calamity.</i>

10:01.490 --> 10:03.460
<i>This time, I won't fail.</i>

10:03.460 --> 10:05.090
<i>I'll finish her for sure.</i>

10:05.090 --> 10:06.190
Doppelganger.

10:09.300 --> 10:12.090
Using the man she loves the most,

10:12.090 --> 10:14.920
Hiiragi Seiichi.

10:14.920 --> 10:17.010
Continued in the second half.

10:23.580 --> 10:25.440
I want to be through 
the mountains by nightfall,

10:25.440 --> 10:26.780
so let's deal with this quickly.

10:26.780 --> 10:28.100
All right.

10:28.100 --> 10:30.980
Then I'll go buy us some drinks.

10:30.980 --> 10:32.450
Okay, thanks.

10:36.580 --> 10:37.480
Huh?

10:44.990 --> 10:47.160
What's the matter?

10:51.600 --> 10:53.340
Are you hurt anywhere?

10:55.440 --> 10:59.840
N-No, I was just recalling the past.

11:01.900 --> 11:03.370
It's nothing.

11:03.370 --> 11:05.270
I'm fine, young lady.

11:05.840 --> 11:07.080
Saria!

11:09.590 --> 11:11.870
I bought drinks, Seiichi.

11:13.060 --> 11:15.560
<i>Hey, have I seen him before?</i>

11:16.550 --> 11:18.130
<i>I found him.</i>

11:18.940 --> 11:22.660
You're Seiichi-sensei from 
Barbador Magic Academy, right?

11:22.660 --> 11:24.390
How do you know me?

11:24.390 --> 11:26.690
You're famous!

11:26.690 --> 11:31.420
I heard you're so super strong that 
the king of Wimberg relies on you!

11:31.420 --> 11:32.970
Huh? Really?

11:32.970 --> 11:34.510
Seiichi, you're amazing!

11:35.010 --> 11:37.420
I heard you're a real hero!

11:38.050 --> 11:41.090
What are you doing here all by yourself?

11:41.090 --> 11:42.110
Me?

11:42.110 --> 11:44.210
I'm on a journey.

11:44.210 --> 11:46.260
Searching for fun things to do.

11:46.260 --> 11:48.750
Wow, how nice!

11:48.750 --> 11:51.440
We're on our way back now.

11:51.770 --> 11:52.580
Hey...

11:52.580 --> 11:55.860
Sensei, are you happy right now?

11:57.570 --> 12:00.930
He is! Right, Seiichi?

12:00.930 --> 12:02.530
Y-Yeah.

12:03.500 --> 12:05.450
I'm jealous.

12:05.450 --> 12:07.370
Huh? What'd you say?

12:07.810 --> 12:10.410
Nothing. See you, Seiichi-sensei.

12:10.410 --> 12:11.660
You're leaving?

12:13.500 --> 12:14.780
It's okay.

12:14.780 --> 12:17.640
We'll meet again for sure.

12:17.640 --> 12:19.130
Bye-bye.

12:37.430 --> 12:39.940
Hey, Ar!

12:41.190 --> 12:43.700
S-Seiichi?

12:43.700 --> 12:45.620
Why are you here?

12:45.620 --> 12:47.620
What about Wimberg? What about Saria?

12:48.270 --> 12:51.830
I came back all by myself 
because I wanted to see you alone.

12:53.130 --> 12:56.290
You're the only one I have 
eyes for right now, Ar.

12:56.290 --> 13:00.210
Wh-Where is this coming from?

13:00.610 --> 13:03.560
Ar, may I hug you?

13:04.130 --> 13:07.800
Wh-What are you saying?

13:09.680 --> 13:11.420
S-Sei—

13:12.910 --> 13:14.640
<i>Got you.</i>

13:16.570 --> 13:20.860
What are you saying?!

13:21.270 --> 13:23.360
What has gotten into you?!

13:25.670 --> 13:27.080
Seiichi!

13:27.740 --> 13:30.420
Seiichi, are you okay?!

13:29.810 --> 13:33.600
<i>Does this Seiichi guy go 
through this all the time?</i>

13:30.420 --> 13:32.840
Sorry, it was force of habit!

13:33.600 --> 13:34.820
B-But...

13:35.530 --> 13:39.090
I really was worried about you back then.

13:42.730 --> 13:46.650
I'm truly glad you came back to life.

13:47.610 --> 13:50.600
<i>I'm the one who brought 
him back to life, though.</i>

13:50.600 --> 13:52.670
I told you before, right?

13:52.670 --> 13:54.920
People call me the Calamity,

13:54.920 --> 13:59.200
but you accepted everything 
about me, and I'm grateful for that.

13:59.200 --> 14:04.030
So I want to accept everything about you, too.

14:04.820 --> 14:06.820
Everything...

14:08.450 --> 14:15.400
<i>No one pays attention to my 
feelings, to my true face.</i>

14:18.920 --> 14:20.220
Why?

14:21.350 --> 14:23.580
I-Isn't that obvious?

14:23.580 --> 14:25.300
Because I—

14:25.890 --> 14:27.170
You?

14:27.640 --> 14:29.760
Because I love you!

14:29.760 --> 14:31.600
L-L-L...

14:35.850 --> 14:37.680
L-Love?

14:37.680 --> 14:42.610
So, Seiichi, go ahead... and hug me!

14:46.130 --> 14:50.910
<i>Is Hiiragi Seiichi really such a good guy?!</i>

14:52.340 --> 14:53.870
H-Huh?

14:55.790 --> 14:56.900
Don't ignore me!

14:56.900 --> 14:58.080
Again?!

15:02.560 --> 15:06.410
<i>Why do they all adore 
Hiiragi Seiichi so much?</i>

15:06.410 --> 15:12.300
<i>I decided to spend some time 
as Seiichi in order to find out.</i>

15:12.300 --> 15:14.720
Everyone did so well on their last quiz.

15:14.720 --> 15:15.990
It's thanks to you, Sensei!

15:15.990 --> 15:18.100
Oh, no, that's not true.

15:17.200 --> 15:18.820
Thank you so much.

15:24.550 --> 15:26.820
This is quite a feast!

15:26.820 --> 15:31.470
It's nice to eat outdoors like this 
every once in a while.

15:31.470 --> 15:33.490
The air is nice, too.

15:33.490 --> 15:36.850
Yeah! This air is yummy!

15:36.850 --> 15:40.470
Lulune, you mean the sandwiches, not the air.

15:40.470 --> 15:41.940
Naturally!

15:44.430 --> 15:45.830
<i>Not good!</i>

15:45.830 --> 15:48.330
<i>I was planning to learn 
why they adore Seiichi,</i>

15:48.330 --> 15:52.630
<i>but I've started enjoying this school life!</i>

15:52.630 --> 15:54.670
So, Principal...

15:54.670 --> 15:58.020
You wanted to discuss 
something with us, didn't you?

15:58.490 --> 16:00.630
Yes, actually.

16:00.630 --> 16:03.690
It's about the Great Devil Order.

16:04.600 --> 16:08.270
You did say that the day 
of the final battle was close.

16:08.270 --> 16:09.560
That's right.

16:09.560 --> 16:13.240
What I want to talk to you about is...

16:16.110 --> 16:17.910
What's this doing here?!

16:17.910 --> 16:22.680
Hmph. It's probably a monster that was 
awakened by the Great Devil's pulse.

16:27.700 --> 16:29.130
This thing's strong!

16:29.780 --> 16:32.050
Get away from it right now!

16:32.050 --> 16:33.750
I'd love to, but...

16:46.810 --> 16:48.110
Seiichi!

16:48.110 --> 16:49.570
Onii-chan, you're amazing!

16:49.570 --> 16:52.490
You're so reliable, Master!

16:53.380 --> 16:56.030
That makes it clear.

16:56.600 --> 17:01.650
To be honest, I've sensed an evil 
presence here at the academy lately,

17:01.650 --> 17:04.960
but I hadn't been able to locate it.

17:05.830 --> 17:10.570
He's an assassin sent 
by the Great Devil Order.

17:11.110 --> 17:12.900
What's wrong, Onii-chan?

17:12.900 --> 17:14.970
You don't look happy.

17:14.970 --> 17:17.130
That's not true. I'm always with—

17:17.130 --> 17:19.610
Hold it right there!

17:22.140 --> 17:25.560
Kannazuki Karen? Why are you here?

17:25.560 --> 17:27.780
You might be able to deceive their eyes,

17:27.780 --> 17:30.310
but you can't deceive my nose!

17:30.310 --> 17:32.980
That man isn't Seiichi-kun!

17:39.030 --> 17:40.450
Onii-chan?

17:40.450 --> 17:42.360
S-Seriously?

17:42.740 --> 17:45.620
Do you... h-have any proof of that?

17:46.010 --> 17:47.600
I have evidence!

17:53.020 --> 17:54.340
Airin?

17:54.630 --> 17:59.510
The one who approached Lulune 
several days ago was a fake Airin.

17:59.890 --> 18:03.950
I rescued the real one from 
the academy's chicken coop.

18:03.950 --> 18:07.020
Man, you really saved me from that one!

18:07.560 --> 18:09.020
I don't know what happened,

18:09.020 --> 18:12.180
but when I came to, I was with the chickens.

18:15.860 --> 18:18.920
Even if you can copy his 
appearance and abilities,

18:18.920 --> 18:23.160
you can't copy Seiichi-kun's 
fragrant body odor.

18:23.160 --> 18:26.810
Then... who in the world are you?

18:28.600 --> 18:31.210
Guess the cat's out of the bag now!

18:31.210 --> 18:32.500
So bright!

18:35.420 --> 18:38.490
I'm one of the Great Devil Order's top four,

18:38.490 --> 18:40.470
Gempel the Doppelganger.

18:40.470 --> 18:44.640
One of the Great Devil Order's top four?!

18:45.160 --> 18:47.590
You're right.

18:47.590 --> 18:51.360
I used the chaos of the fight 
between Seiichi and the apostles

18:52.740 --> 18:55.410
to swap places with that lady there.

18:57.070 --> 18:59.030
Why would you do that?!

18:59.030 --> 19:03.900
Because I want to capture you all 
and eliminate you in front of Seiichi.

19:03.900 --> 19:08.710
That's the best strategy for 
plunging him into the pit of despair!

19:08.710 --> 19:10.290
What?!

19:11.090 --> 19:15.090
At least, that was the plan before 
I became Seiichi and realized something.

19:16.820 --> 19:21.630
I lived my entire life 
without being loved by anyone,

19:21.630 --> 19:25.100
so I never cared if anyone else died.

19:25.780 --> 19:27.680
But now, I think I understand.

19:27.680 --> 19:32.300
Losing the people precious 
to you is a very sad thing.

19:34.210 --> 19:37.530
That's why I couldn't help saving you all.

19:39.270 --> 19:41.730
I'm such an idiot.

19:42.950 --> 19:44.240
You...

19:47.000 --> 19:52.610
From now on, I think I'll try to find 
someone to accept me like Seiichi did.

19:52.610 --> 19:54.680
Someone who will be fond of me.

19:54.680 --> 19:56.760
At least, that's how I want to live.

19:57.350 --> 20:00.580
Though I doubt I'll ever measure up to him.

20:02.220 --> 20:03.220
Later.

20:05.490 --> 20:07.540
You can do it.

20:08.840 --> 20:10.490
I can smell that potential in you.

20:14.540 --> 20:18.150
Thanks, lady with the keen nose.

20:21.400 --> 20:24.110
Should we really just let him go?

20:24.110 --> 20:30.990
With his power, it would be 
a trivial matter to kill us all.

20:30.990 --> 20:32.830
Yet he didn't do that.

20:33.460 --> 20:36.860
So I want to believe in him.

20:37.420 --> 20:40.610
I want to believe there's a ray of hope

20:40.610 --> 20:44.420
for those who have made mistakes, as well.

20:52.180 --> 20:55.460
Well, what should I do now?

21:02.910 --> 21:04.450
You, huh?

21:05.540 --> 21:06.860
Perfect timing.

21:07.240 --> 21:10.290
I'm leaving the Great Devil Order.

21:12.200 --> 21:16.130
I don't care about all this despair 
and Great Devil stuff anymore.

21:16.580 --> 21:20.670
So I'm going to find someone 
to love, who'll love m—

21:34.560 --> 21:36.730
That boy was cute, wasn't he?

21:36.730 --> 21:38.870
Yeah, he was.

21:40.110 --> 21:41.760
What's the matter?

21:41.760 --> 21:42.820
Well...

21:42.820 --> 21:46.380
I just feel like I've seen him 
somewhere before.

23:21.300 --> 23:24.900
Everyone, the battle against 
the Great Devil Order is nigh!

23:24.900 --> 23:26.750
So let's put our spirit into it!

23:26.750 --> 23:28.980
Yeah!

23:31.590 --> 23:34.420
Now, let's commence the operation.

23:35.990 --> 23:38.170
A murderer is on the loose 
in that crazy guild!

23:38.170 --> 23:39.670
The victim is the pacifier man!

23:39.670 --> 23:40.820
Wait, who's that?

23:40.820 --> 23:42.510
Guscle and the others set out to resolve it,

23:42.510 --> 23:44.440
but wait, will I get to show up at all?!

23:44.440 --> 23:46.450
Next time: "Vitor the Resonance."

23:44.440 --> 23:47.730
<b>Next Time
Victor the Resonance</b>

23:46.450 --> 23:49.990
It's a sausage fest of perverted 
gentlemen showing off!
